tives\n  - ❄️ 冷链锁鲜 / Cold Chain Freshness\n- Layout: Icons followed by bilingual text, separated by slashes.\n\nBottom Bar:\n- Tmall search bar style: \"淘宝 | 天猫 农夫山泉官方旗舰店 🔍\"\n- Date & CTA: \"3/21-3/24 新美力周 把春天喝下去 DRINK THE SPRING →\" (White text on a soft orange gradient background pill button)\n\n---"
